; Reverse zone of the scanned lab network, 10.77.3.0/24.
;
; The names recorded here are what check 2.7 expects to find stored with a
; scan of the lab. Every address is a host of ../manifest.yaml.
;
;   - 10.77.3.10 has two names.
;   - 10.77.3.30 and 10.77.3.40 have none: a lookup for them answers "no such name".
;
; A unit test (tests/unit/test_lab_resolver.py) checks this file against the manifest.

$ORIGIN 3.77.10.in-addr.arpa.
$TTL 60

@    IN SOA ns.lab.test. hostmaster.lab.test. (
             2026111601 ; serial
             3600       ; refresh
             600        ; retry
             86400      ; expire
             60 )       ; negative answers
     IN NS  ns.lab.test.

0    IN PTR first.lab.test.
10   IN PTR web.lab.test.
10   IN PTR www.lab.test.
11   IN PTR mail.lab.test.
20   IN PTR fw-quiet.lab.test.
21   IN PTR db.lab.test.
255  IN PTR last.lab.test.
